# 1. Secrets, Credentials, Tokens & Environment Files (NEVER COMMIT)
.env
.env*
**/.env
**/.env*
*secret*
*Secret*
*SECRET*
*token*
*Token*
*TOKEN*
*credential*
*Credential*
*CREDENTIAL*
**/secure/
**/cf_blog_keys.json
*.pem
*.key
*.keystore
*.jks
*.p12
*.pfx

# 2. Browsers, Cookies & Session Profiles
browsers/
**/browsers/
cookies/
**/cookies/
*cookie*
*Cookie*
User Data/
**/User Data/

